  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Applying Kirchhoff&#39;s law in closed loop,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></math><br />&nbsp;</p>",
